WEBVTT

01:14.089 --> 01:18.765
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.989 --> 01:24.501
[Episode 27]

01:35.389 --> 01:38.789
[Tomb of Chen Nanxing]

01:38.789 --> 01:40.069
Nanxing,

01:40.219 --> 01:42.965
Hongdou comes from afar to see you.

01:42.989 --> 01:49.685
Please bless her success in work
and peace in life.

01:49.709 --> 01:51.299
As long as she can get some rest.

01:51.299 --> 01:53.079
Don't bother to bless me.

01:54.429 --> 01:56.629
I won't disturb you two anymore.

01:56.859 --> 01:58.139
Let's go.

01:58.219 --> 01:59.429
Right.

01:59.429 --> 02:00.549
Don't be in a hurry.

02:00.549 --> 02:03.349
We are waiting for you in the parking lot.

02:55.539 --> 02:56.819
See?

02:58.309 --> 02:59.681
Full of rewards.

03:01.939 --> 03:03.719
What you told me to do,

03:05.099 --> 03:06.831
I did most of them.

03:08.819 --> 03:10.215
I made friends.

03:10.819 --> 03:12.699
I tasted a lot of good food.

03:12.699 --> 03:14.467
I had a lot of fun.

03:15.869 --> 03:18.669
I also found the feeling of being a child.

03:19.309 --> 03:20.819
How does that feel?

03:20.819 --> 03:22.099
It's just...

03:24.629 --> 03:25.917
I don't know.

03:27.069 --> 03:30.457
Probably, the feeling
closest to happiness.

03:38.069 --> 03:39.849
I'll show you the photos.

03:46.289 --> 03:51.969
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

03:53.639 --> 03:59.523
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

04:01.029 --> 04:07.189
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

04:07.189 --> 04:13.889
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

04:15.889 --> 04:21.449
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

04:23.239 --> 04:25.739
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

04:25.739 --> 04:27.219
Poplar in the Water.

04:27.269 --> 04:28.869
Do you still remember?

04:30.299 --> 04:31.060
And this one.

04:31.060 --> 04:37.218
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

04:37.219 --> 04:37.830
Is he handsome?

04:37.830 --> 04:44.973
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

04:45.355 --> 04:52.058
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

04:52.059 --> 04:54.709
Our agreement is always valid.

04:54.709 --> 04:58.061
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

05:00.089 --> 05:01.675
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

05:01.675 --> 05:06.652
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

05:07.059 --> 05:08.269
I have to go now.

05:08.269 --> 05:09.469
Take care of yourselves.

05:09.469 --> 05:10.299
All right.

05:10.299 --> 05:10.789
You should go now.

05:10.789 --> 05:12.449
Don't let the car wait.

05:14.539 --> 05:16.463
Be safe.

05:16.619 --> 05:17.909
Text me when you get back.

05:17.909 --> 05:20.589
Please say hello to your parents for me.

05:21.469 --> 05:22.749
Take care.

05:31.299 --> 05:33.269
This is a return, not trash.

05:33.269 --> 05:34.389
It is to be sold again.

05:34.389 --> 05:35.659
Why do you throw it like that?

05:35.659 --> 05:37.269
This is just tea.

05:37.269 --> 05:38.469
Can tea be thrown like that?

05:38.469 --> 05:39.150
Won't the tea leaves be broken?

05:39.150 --> 05:41.170
Won't the teapot be deflated?

05:53.059 --> 05:54.539
What are you doing?

05:54.789 --> 05:55.979
I just touched you.

05:55.979 --> 05:57.659
You almost kicked him.

05:57.659 --> 06:00.059
If you kick someone, I need to compensate.

06:00.059 --> 06:02.589
Do you know how much loan our family has?

06:02.589 --> 06:04.549
Can I put you in a mortgage?

06:05.909 --> 06:06.740
Well, you're in a bad mood?

06:06.740 --> 06:08.469
Hearing me talking like that?

06:08.469 --> 06:10.129
I am in a bad mood too.

06:11.419 --> 06:12.863
No dinner tonight.

06:22.219 --> 06:23.269
Getting the 14th place in the exam,

06:23.269 --> 06:24.949
you dare to talk back to your mother.

06:24.949 --> 06:26.149
If you get into Tsinghua or Peking University,

06:26.149 --> 06:28.589
the whole family has to welcome you
on their knees, right?

06:28.589 --> 06:30.537
What attitude you have!

06:32.349 --> 06:34.059
You call this a good attitude?

06:34.059 --> 06:34.589
Fine.

06:34.589 --> 06:36.597
Let's talk about this today.

06:36.739 --> 06:39.839
Don't you know what state you are in at school?

06:43.779 --> 06:44.269
[Yunmiao Village Service Station]

06:44.269 --> 06:45.859
Who is the thief in the end?

06:45.859 --> 06:46.829
You are the thief!

06:46.829 --> 06:47.909
You stole the land!

06:47.909 --> 06:48.740
You occupied such a large piece!

06:48.740 --> 06:49.619
Uncle, it's enough.

06:49.619 --> 06:50.389
Go measure.

06:50.389 --> 06:52.469
But, uncle... Do it!

06:52.469 --> 06:53.539
Let Huang take the lead to measure.

06:53.539 --> 06:54.150
Can we stop?

06:54.150 --> 06:55.859
Did the ridging affect your field?

06:55.859 --> 06:56.619
Give me back my corn!

06:56.619 --> 06:56.979
No.

06:56.979 --> 06:57.389
Let's not do it!

06:57.389 --> 06:58.929
Give me back my corn!

06:59.299 --> 07:00.599
Stop it!

07:02.299 --> 07:03.579
Uncles.

07:03.949 --> 07:06.689
We can't deal with it by talking, can we?

07:07.589 --> 07:08.539
Come.

07:08.539 --> 07:09.819
Smash.

07:10.419 --> 07:11.469
Look what you did to me last time.

07:11.469 --> 07:13.269
It is still not recovered.

07:13.269 --> 07:14.349
Just smash it.

07:14.349 --> 07:16.501
Let your anger out.

07:16.619 --> 07:18.979
Don't do it all year round,
once when sowing the seeds,

07:18.979 --> 07:20.699
once during the harvest.

07:21.349 --> 07:22.733
I'm really tired.

07:22.909 --> 07:24.149
Smash, smash here.

07:24.149 --> 07:24.979
Come on, with this.

07:24.979 --> 07:25.390
Smash with this.

07:25.390 --> 07:27.979
Come on, smash.

07:27.979 --> 07:28.710
Yao.

07:28.710 --> 07:30.513
Don't.

08:10.099 --> 08:11.739
Why doesn't she come?

08:11.739 --> 08:13.389
Hasn't she got in the taxi?

08:13.389 --> 08:14.469
Yes.

08:14.469 --> 08:16.033
How's your sauce?

08:16.099 --> 08:16.949
It's ready.

08:16.949 --> 08:18.619
The fat has been stewed.

08:18.619 --> 08:19.899
That's good.

08:21.389 --> 08:23.979
Or I will go to the entrance of
the housing estate to get her.

08:23.979 --> 08:25.059
Then you should go.

08:25.059 --> 08:27.029
You can't sit still at home anyway.

08:27.029 --> 08:29.289
Like there is a nail in your ass.

08:30.389 --> 08:31.669
She is back!

08:31.819 --> 08:33.599
You can cook the noodles!

08:34.909 --> 08:36.269
Dou, you're back.

08:36.269 --> 08:37.179
Dad!

08:37.179 --> 08:38.869
The apron is dirty.

08:38.869 --> 08:39.659
What's in the stew?

08:39.659 --> 08:40.029
Smells good.

08:40.029 --> 08:41.309
My turn!

08:42.029 --> 08:43.029
You are overindulged.

08:43.029 --> 08:43.789
Not coming back.

08:43.789 --> 08:45.339
Your waist is thick again.

08:45.339 --> 08:46.029
Get lost.

08:46.029 --> 08:47.149
Wash your hands!

08:47.149 --> 08:48.269
Where is the luggage I sent back?

08:48.269 --> 08:49.419
It's in your room.

08:49.419 --> 08:49.939
Hurry up.

08:49.939 --> 08:50.789
Okay.

08:50.789 --> 08:52.305
Come on!

08:52.419 --> 08:55.999
Your mom made your favorite,
noodles with soybean paste.

08:56.389 --> 08:59.249
Here are the noodles!

09:04.629 --> 09:05.389
Come.

09:05.389 --> 09:07.029
The sugar garlic you asked for.

09:07.029 --> 09:08.339
Why didn't you eat?

09:08.339 --> 09:11.115
Your dad said to wait for you.

09:11.699 --> 09:13.339
Dumplings for leaving, noodles for coming back.

09:13.339 --> 09:16.149
Your mom is worried that
you've eaten on the road.

09:16.149 --> 09:17.059
Come.

09:17.059 --> 09:18.579
Eat before they get cold.

09:18.579 --> 09:19.539
I tell you what.

09:19.539 --> 09:21.749
I knew that you must have made
delicious food for me.

09:21.749 --> 09:23.229
So I didn't eat anything.

09:23.229 --> 09:25.069
This is what I call smart.

09:25.629 --> 09:27.289
How is it? Is it salty?

09:29.179 --> 09:29.909
Especially delicious.

09:29.909 --> 09:31.629
Number one in the world.

09:33.989 --> 09:37.665
How are Nanxing's parents?

09:38.819 --> 09:40.239
They are all right.

09:40.989 --> 09:42.269
Well.

09:42.539 --> 09:45.399
They asked me to say hello for them to you.

09:48.419 --> 09:50.151
Don't sigh.

09:50.819 --> 09:52.789
How's the new home coming along?

09:52.789 --> 09:53.989
Almost done.

09:53.989 --> 09:55.459
The house has been cleaned.

09:55.459 --> 09:56.419
Formaldehyde has also been tested.

09:56.419 --> 09:57.789
The air quality has met the standard.

09:57.789 --> 10:02.269
Recently, your mom and I have already moved
a lot of things over there.

10:02.299 --> 10:05.539
We don't know how to do with the stuff
in your room.

10:05.539 --> 10:06.909
To throw or to keep.

10:06.909 --> 10:08.419
You can clean up when you come back.

10:08.419 --> 10:10.259
What's wrong with my room?

10:10.579 --> 10:12.395
See for yourself.

10:12.419 --> 10:13.699
Magazine 20 years ago.

10:13.699 --> 10:14.579
You still have it.

10:14.579 --> 10:15.989
Why do you want to keep it?

10:15.989 --> 10:17.661
Remembrance.

10:17.869 --> 10:21.819
I think you can live together with
Grandma Liu next building.

10:21.819 --> 10:23.503
Keeping everything.

10:23.629 --> 10:25.579
Picking up junk to home every day.

10:25.579 --> 10:27.819
She never listens to her son or daughter-in-law.

10:27.819 --> 10:31.555
There is no place to put your feet
on since the pile of junk at home.

10:31.579 --> 10:34.795
Your mom likes to talk exaggeratedly.

10:34.819 --> 10:35.939
I don't see much stuff.

10:35.939 --> 10:36.629
Just one cabinet.

10:36.629 --> 10:37.989
It's not too much.

10:38.749 --> 10:40.179
Didn't you say that the other day?

10:40.179 --> 10:43.627
Do we need to throw the cabinet of junk?

10:43.699 --> 10:45.629
You've become a good person now.

10:45.629 --> 10:47.269
When did I say that's junk?

10:47.269 --> 10:49.059
I said they were old items.

10:49.059 --> 10:50.699
Junk. Items.

10:50.699 --> 10:52.459
You didn't hear clearly.

10:52.459 --> 10:54.459
Okay, next time you talk, I'll record it.

10:54.459 --> 10:56.419
I didn't say that anyway.

10:56.419 --> 10:58.149
This is called selective memory loss.

10:58.149 --> 10:59.539
Remember if he wants to.

10:59.539 --> 11:01.860
If he doesn't want to remember,
the matter doesn't exist.

12:08.699 --> 12:10.749
Sister, auntie said you're back.

12:10.749 --> 12:12.909
My mom and I will go to your house in two days.

12:12.909 --> 12:15.733
Remember to buy me cherries in advance.

12:17.109 --> 12:21.748
[Xie Zhiyao: Have you seen her parents?
Xu Hongdou: No. Need to take the bus now.]

12:21.749 --> 12:24.861
[Xie Zhiyao: Take care.
Xu Hongdou: Thanks!]

12:26.789 --> 12:32.589
[What are you doing...]

12:56.789 --> 13:01.437
[Moments: My mom's hand-made noodles
are the best in the universe.]

13:06.349 --> 13:09.941
[Mai: Leave the bowl to me when you finish.]

13:15.029 --> 13:19.821
[Reply to Mai: You're really a spider,
always online...]

13:26.939 --> 13:30.819
Yang Zhinan is way out of line!

13:30.989 --> 13:32.179
We just get together.

13:32.179 --> 13:33.629
It was his first birthday.

13:33.629 --> 13:35.819
I made a point of asking him what day it is.

13:35.819 --> 13:39.789
It was easy to know that I want to
buy him a gift and celebrate it together.

13:39.789 --> 13:42.909
At five o'clock today, I
went to pick up the cake.

13:42.909 --> 13:45.481
I also got my hair styled for him.

13:45.909 --> 13:47.939
I called him to see if he was off work.

13:47.939 --> 13:50.419
He said to me he didn't work today.

13:50.419 --> 13:53.147
He asked for leave and went home.

13:53.579 --> 13:55.551
He went home?

13:56.339 --> 13:58.599
I asked him why he had gone home.

13:58.659 --> 14:01.149
He said he took time off to go home
for his birthday.

14:01.149 --> 14:02.539
He said it was okay.

14:02.539 --> 14:05.519
I could give him the birthday gift tomorrow.

14:07.789 --> 14:08.939
I'm so angry.

14:08.939 --> 14:10.749
I want to break up with him!

14:10.749 --> 14:12.313
Wait a minute, Qin.

14:12.699 --> 14:15.579
That boy, he may not
have been in love before.

14:15.579 --> 14:17.029
He is an honest man.

14:17.029 --> 14:18.229
He doesn't know about this.

14:18.229 --> 14:19.299
How does he not know?

14:19.299 --> 14:21.149
Doesn't he want to be with me every day?

14:21.149 --> 14:23.539
Won't you get bored soon if you
get together every day?

14:23.539 --> 14:25.019
Will he get bored?

14:25.789 --> 14:27.749
Will he get bored with me?

14:27.749 --> 14:29.709
Not him.

14:29.749 --> 14:33.845
I mean... You can't hang
out with him every day.

14:33.869 --> 14:36.269
People get tired no matter
how beautiful you are.

14:36.269 --> 14:39.717
When you're in love, you
need to give him space.

14:39.789 --> 14:41.069
Space?

14:41.179 --> 14:43.109
Why does love need space?

14:43.109 --> 14:45.059
I've given him enough space.

14:45.059 --> 14:48.035
I didn't ask him to call me during work time.

14:48.059 --> 14:51.279
He just needs to send me location
every half hour.

14:52.059 --> 14:55.149
Qin, I don't want to
teach you how to do it.

14:55.149 --> 14:57.869
Yang Guanjun, watch your mouth.

14:57.869 --> 15:00.909
In terms of seniority, I am your sister-in-law

15:04.659 --> 15:06.699
Jiabao and Guobao call you sister.

15:06.699 --> 15:08.109
You're my sister-in-law?

15:08.109 --> 15:11.419
If you agree with me,
I can call you brother.

15:11.419 --> 15:14.963
But if you disagree, I
am your sister-in-law.

15:16.579 --> 15:18.459
That's not what I mean.

15:18.459 --> 15:20.947
I'm just saying, I've been there.

15:20.989 --> 15:23.389
If you guys hang out every
day, you'll get bored very soon.

15:23.389 --> 15:24.689
Do you know that?

15:25.419 --> 15:26.779
He will get bored.

15:27.659 --> 15:29.727
Will he?

15:30.149 --> 15:32.059
Oh my god, Uncle Yao, do you hear that?

15:32.059 --> 15:32.790
Yes, I do.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.179
He will get bored!

15:34.179 --> 15:35.459
What's wrong with him?

15:35.459 --> 15:36.855
He goes too far!

15:37.229 --> 15:39.381
Yang Zhinan goes too far.

15:39.419 --> 15:40.579
What space does he need?

15:40.579 --> 15:42.539
What space does love need?

15:42.539 --> 15:45.269
Shouldn't you and the person you like
spend every second of your life together?

15:45.269 --> 15:46.179
Right?

15:46.179 --> 15:48.459
Qin looks so gorgeous today.

15:48.459 --> 15:49.579
She also bought a cake.

15:49.579 --> 15:52.229
But Yang Zhinan came home.

15:52.229 --> 15:55.579
If a guy has a girlfriend, won't
he celebrate his birthday with her?

15:55.579 --> 15:57.059
Do you know what it means?

15:57.059 --> 15:58.419
What does it mean?

15:58.699 --> 16:01.379
It means he doesn't care much about you.

16:04.989 --> 16:06.613
Yang Zhinan!

16:07.749 --> 16:09.339
I want to break up with him.

16:09.339 --> 16:10.149
Break up.

16:10.149 --> 16:11.029
Right now.

16:11.029 --> 16:11.699
Call him.

16:11.699 --> 16:12.789
Say goodbye to him.

16:12.789 --> 16:13.459
He goes too far.

16:13.459 --> 16:14.109
Qin.

16:14.109 --> 16:14.789
Don't call him.

16:14.789 --> 16:16.269
Yang Guanjun, you stay right there.

16:16.269 --> 16:18.649
You're not going to change my mind.

16:21.869 --> 16:22.909
Yang Zhinan.

16:22.909 --> 16:24.339
I give you space.

16:24.339 --> 16:25.619
Let's break up!

16:32.989 --> 16:35.717
I don't have a boyfriend anymore.

16:37.789 --> 16:38.989
Qin.

16:38.989 --> 16:40.459
Listen to me.

16:40.459 --> 16:42.947
Let's not shed tears for love.

16:46.819 --> 16:48.539
You should concentrate on your career.

16:48.539 --> 16:49.899
Do you understand?

16:51.269 --> 16:54.573
I don't even have a career.

16:58.709 --> 16:59.989
Xie Zhiyao.

17:00.099 --> 17:01.789
Why do you fan the flames?

17:01.789 --> 17:04.229
In the blink of an eye, Qin
had become single again.

17:04.229 --> 17:06.339
If you are not on her side to support her,

17:06.339 --> 17:08.719
I won't let you get away with this.

17:11.989 --> 17:16.337
You're jealous that she has a boyfriend
when you're single.

17:16.619 --> 17:17.579
Right?

17:17.579 --> 17:18.579
Yang Guanjun.

17:18.579 --> 17:20.619
Don't you dare talk to Uncle Yao like this.

17:20.619 --> 17:22.709
Only Uncle Yao in the world is on my side.

17:22.709 --> 17:23.819
Yes.

17:23.819 --> 17:25.683
I am always on your side.

17:27.429 --> 17:28.709
Uncle Yao.

17:28.859 --> 17:30.627
Why don't you marry me?

17:36.539 --> 17:38.739
Great, look at what you've done.

17:45.189 --> 17:47.059
What's wrong? Is it the fish bone?

17:47.059 --> 17:48.189
Karma is real.

17:48.189 --> 17:49.469
Uncle Yao.

17:49.859 --> 17:51.219
It's really stuck!

17:53.429 --> 17:54.060
Don't eat the cake!

17:54.060 --> 17:55.269
Go to the hospital!

17:55.269 --> 17:56.189
Go.

17:56.189 --> 17:57.229
Uncle Yao, don't cough.

17:57.229 --> 17:58.553
I am scared.

18:04.899 --> 18:06.059
Don't swallow saliva.

18:06.059 --> 18:07.339
Hang in there.

18:08.059 --> 18:09.429
Fortunately, it's not very deep.

18:09.429 --> 18:11.449
It just stuck to the tonsils.

18:11.619 --> 18:13.831
Your tonsils look so beautiful.

18:15.139 --> 18:16.775
Very good.

18:18.029 --> 18:19.353
It's out.

18:20.189 --> 18:22.749
It's been a long time since I saw
someone swallow such a big fish bone.

18:22.749 --> 18:24.229
How did that happen?

18:24.819 --> 18:25.859
I don't know.

18:25.859 --> 18:28.669
Every day there are people like you
coming here for emergency care.

18:28.669 --> 18:30.579
You must be careful while eating fish.

18:30.579 --> 18:31.579
You're smart.

18:31.579 --> 18:32.989
You chose to come to the hospital.

18:32.989 --> 18:34.859
Many people drink vinegar, swallow rice,

18:34.859 --> 18:36.099
making the fish bone get deeper.

18:36.099 --> 18:39.019
It'll be dangerous if it cuts the esophagus.

18:40.819 --> 18:41.819
Just a moment.

18:41.819 --> 18:43.347
I'll take a picture.

18:43.989 --> 18:46.339
Doesn't your girlfriend come with you?

18:46.339 --> 18:50.159
You were here accompanying a girl
for infusion, weren't you?

18:54.189 --> 18:55.729
Thank god, it's okay.

18:55.819 --> 18:57.229
You scared the hell out of me.

18:57.229 --> 18:57.899
Let's go.

18:57.899 --> 18:58.789
Qin.

18:58.789 --> 19:00.709
When I was a child, a fish
bone also lodged in my throat,

19:00.709 --> 19:02.429
which was bigger than his.

19:02.429 --> 19:03.539
This big.

19:03.539 --> 19:04.899
Really?

19:04.899 --> 19:06.819
At that time, I was scared to death.

19:06.819 --> 19:09.725
You must be careful while eating fish later.

19:09.749 --> 19:11.379
You just let him eat the cake.

19:11.379 --> 19:13.429
The doctor said, no food.

19:13.429 --> 19:15.269
I didn't know that he can't even eat a cake.

19:15.269 --> 19:19.289
[Moments: A huge fish bone
got stuck in my tonsil.] You know it now.

19:19.289 --> 19:26.108
♫ I've been alone into the unknown ♫

19:26.109 --> 19:32.939
♫ Can't navigate through the dark ♫

19:32.939 --> 19:40.149
♫ I'm searching for a meadow of mine ♫

19:40.149 --> 19:47.039
♫ Till you came in with the breeze ♫

19:47.039 --> 19:54.669
♫ Feeling a rush out of me,
spills my heart into the field ♫

19:54.669 --> 20:01.269
♫ I know it, I will be yours ♫

20:01.269 --> 20:04.269
♫ Would you ask for any horse ♫

20:04.269 --> 20:08.859
♫ But this one inside your heart ♫

20:08.859 --> 20:11.155
She didn't even give me a like.

20:11.949 --> 20:14.269
I accompanied you to the infusion.

20:26.899 --> 20:29.099
A fish bone stuck in the throat?

20:31.469 --> 20:32.479
[Mai: You're my role model!]

20:32.479 --> 20:37.109
♫ Spills my heart into the field ♫

20:37.109 --> 20:44.069
♫ I know it, I will be yours ♫

20:44.069 --> 20:47.269
♫ Would you ask for any horse ♫

20:47.269 --> 20:48.139
♫ But this one inside your heart ♫

20:48.139 --> 20:50.685
Dou, wake up for breakfast.

20:50.709 --> 20:51.899
Okay.

20:51.899 --> 20:52.470
Hurry up.

20:52.470 --> 20:59.089
♫ I'll give you the saddle of mine ♫

20:59.089 --> 21:05.869
♫ You ask me if the wind could sing ♫

21:05.869 --> 21:09.215
♫ We close our eyes ♫

21:09.215 --> 21:10.695
You have a headache?

21:10.789 --> 21:12.069
No.

21:13.299 --> 21:15.451
You should eat well.

21:15.709 --> 21:18.205
Or you have no energy.

21:18.229 --> 21:22.188
People need the energy to get sad.

21:22.189 --> 21:23.789
Well, why do you think I am sad?

21:23.789 --> 21:26.229
What are you talking about, grandma?

21:28.789 --> 21:30.149
I'll eat it later.

21:32.669 --> 21:33.993
Grandma.

21:34.099 --> 21:36.245
She doesn't send me messages.

21:36.269 --> 21:38.589
I can't text her on my initiative.

21:38.949 --> 21:41.509
Why can't you send her messages first?

21:41.989 --> 21:44.355
You have a bad cell phone signal?

21:44.379 --> 21:45.659
I am serious.

21:46.619 --> 21:47.270
Here is the thing.

21:47.270 --> 21:49.515
The initiative is not in my hands.

21:49.539 --> 21:51.019
Before she left,

21:51.339 --> 21:52.619
I told her.

21:53.899 --> 21:55.199
What did you say?

21:58.669 --> 21:59.949
I said...

22:00.539 --> 22:01.935
I like her.

22:08.899 --> 22:11.379
I won't talk about it anymore
if you act like this.

22:11.379 --> 22:12.763
Say it.

22:13.269 --> 22:15.985
You like her, and?

22:16.749 --> 22:17.949
Nothing else.

22:17.949 --> 22:20.555
I told her how I feel and that's it.

22:20.579 --> 22:24.669
Well... She said... No more contact?

22:24.669 --> 22:25.749
Of course not.

22:25.749 --> 22:27.539
She just said to keep in touch.

22:27.539 --> 22:29.559
We are still friends.

22:29.819 --> 22:31.299
That's it.

22:31.299 --> 22:35.708
You told her everything, and now you are shy.

22:35.709 --> 22:37.029
Don't be shy.

22:37.029 --> 22:38.929
Take the initiative.

22:39.099 --> 22:44.755
Maybe it works out and you will have
an online relationship.

22:44.899 --> 22:45.899
Grandma.

22:45.899 --> 22:49.029
She doesn't want an online relationship
or a long-distance relationship.

22:49.029 --> 22:50.989
Then you should go to find her often.

22:50.989 --> 22:52.299
Fly from Yunnan to Beijing.

22:52.299 --> 22:54.115
From Beijing to Yunnan.

22:54.339 --> 22:55.619
I have money.

22:55.899 --> 22:58.147
I've saved money for you.

22:58.619 --> 23:00.459
You've saved money for me?

23:00.579 --> 23:02.299
How much have you saved?

23:02.339 --> 23:03.619
Wait a minute.

23:10.949 --> 23:12.229
Look.

23:23.539 --> 23:24.819
What...

23:32.189 --> 23:35.721
I was going to give you the money

23:35.949 --> 23:39.789
if things don't work out for you here.

23:39.789 --> 23:41.875
You can go back to Beijing then.

23:41.899 --> 23:47.445
Or if you get married, this can be
the start-up fund for your family.

23:47.469 --> 23:51.099
Of course, it's not enough
to buy a house or land.

23:51.099 --> 23:54.403
But it can be the emergency fund.

23:57.469 --> 23:58.749
I think...

23:59.269 --> 24:00.833
Hongdou's leaving,

24:01.059 --> 24:03.271
is good for both of you.

24:03.789 --> 24:05.401
Young people like you

24:05.579 --> 24:08.211
are having "fast-food affection".

24:08.269 --> 24:10.539
Once she leaves, you become calm down.

24:10.539 --> 24:13.925
If you're thinking of each other,

24:13.949 --> 24:16.555
then think about the way forward.

24:16.579 --> 24:17.879
What's your plan?

24:18.539 --> 24:20.355
Don't be in a hurry.

24:24.619 --> 24:26.723
Me and your grandpa.

24:27.859 --> 24:29.579
We started with nothing.

24:29.899 --> 24:32.699
We spend a lifetime to understand a truth.

24:32.789 --> 24:34.099
That is.

24:34.099 --> 24:37.515
You fight for what you want.

24:37.539 --> 24:39.979
Don't wait for someone else to give.

24:42.899 --> 24:44.229
Cheer up.

24:44.229 --> 24:46.299
Don't be downcast.

24:46.299 --> 24:47.579
Understand?

24:49.029 --> 24:50.269
Understood.

24:50.269 --> 24:51.749
Then you should eat.

24:53.339 --> 24:56.175
Grandma, is this bankbook for me?

24:56.339 --> 24:58.899
You can have it when you buy a ticket.

25:00.539 --> 25:02.223
But I am still curious.

25:02.299 --> 25:04.439
How did you save so much money?

25:06.819 --> 25:10.948
I just... called your dad constantly,

25:10.949 --> 25:14.539
saying I had a headache or a sore butt.

25:14.539 --> 25:15.949
I asked him for money.

25:15.949 --> 25:17.609
And I saved it for you.

25:19.339 --> 25:20.579
I'll take a call.

25:20.579 --> 25:21.859
It's from Huang.

25:23.059 --> 25:23.899
Hello, Huang?

25:23.899 --> 25:24.989
Hello, Xie?

25:24.989 --> 25:27.669
Shaohua Bookstore's team will come in five days.

25:27.669 --> 25:28.189
Are you sure?

25:28.189 --> 25:28.989
Yes, I am sure.

25:28.989 --> 25:30.059
Coming for a meeting.

25:30.059 --> 25:31.839
Okay, I'll be right over.

25:31.899 --> 25:34.669
Grandma, I have to go to the village council
for a meeting.

25:34.669 --> 25:36.229
You can't eat again.

25:36.229 --> 25:37.429
Take it and eat it on the way.

25:37.429 --> 25:38.269
Okay.

25:38.269 --> 25:39.749
Can I have that one?

25:40.429 --> 25:41.849
Thank you, grandma.

25:42.139 --> 25:43.419
I'm off.

25:54.859 --> 25:56.539
When I was in Yunmiao Village,

25:56.539 --> 25:58.619
I got up before dawn and went to that town

25:58.619 --> 26:01.749
to eat rice noodles in a small pot
from the food market.

26:01.749 --> 26:04.269
A slacker like you can get up early?

26:04.269 --> 26:05.749
Someone called me.

26:05.749 --> 26:09.669
Xie Zhiyao's home is just one lane
away from the house where I lived.

26:09.669 --> 26:11.989
I can see their yard from my window.

26:11.989 --> 26:13.189
He got up early.

26:13.189 --> 26:15.379
Then he took small stones to smash my window.

26:15.379 --> 26:15.990
You know what?

26:15.990 --> 26:19.630
Only local people know where to find
that kind of bistro.

26:23.859 --> 26:25.619
You're talking about the young man

26:25.619 --> 26:27.709
who came home to start his own business, right?

26:27.709 --> 26:29.609
That's him. He's very nice.

26:32.949 --> 26:34.477
How old is he?

26:35.189 --> 26:36.469
In his 30s.

26:39.299 --> 26:41.789
I think he is quite a gentleman.

26:41.789 --> 26:43.509
Why is he still single?

26:43.899 --> 26:45.669
He hasn't met the right girl?

26:45.669 --> 26:49.489
The last time he was in a relationship
was still in college.

26:49.539 --> 26:51.799
That was more than ten years ago.

26:53.749 --> 26:57.515
Could it be there is something wrong
with his...

26:57.539 --> 26:58.935
Mom.

27:00.189 --> 27:02.189
What's so embarrassing about it?

27:02.189 --> 27:04.469
He just haven't met the right girl.

27:04.469 --> 27:07.617
No one would think about physical defects.

27:07.709 --> 27:09.379
Everyone would think about this way.

27:09.379 --> 27:11.303
What else could it be?

27:11.339 --> 27:12.579
He sets the bar too high.

27:12.579 --> 27:13.949
Your daughter doesn't have a boyfriend.

27:13.949 --> 27:15.189
Is there something wrong with me too?

27:15.189 --> 27:16.899
Of course, you have no problem with that.

27:16.899 --> 27:18.989
Now it's normal for girls to marry late.

27:18.989 --> 27:20.619
Mom, you're having a double standard.

27:20.619 --> 27:21.579
Of course.

27:21.579 --> 27:24.835
I raise you, I love you. Any problem?

27:25.989 --> 27:28.729
You're just too far away from each other.

27:31.029 --> 27:32.059
Just eat.

27:32.059 --> 27:34.379
I'll take you out after breakfast.

27:34.619 --> 27:36.299
I don't go fishing with dad.

27:36.299 --> 27:37.819
Who said to go fishing?

27:37.819 --> 27:39.779
Let's go pick peaches, okay?

27:40.029 --> 27:41.029
Peach picking.

27:41.029 --> 27:42.309
Eat.

27:50.819 --> 27:54.859
The peaches Hongdou picked are very good.

27:54.859 --> 27:57.539
One has to weigh 250 g, right?

27:57.579 --> 27:59.311
It's sweet.

28:00.469 --> 28:01.749
What is it?

28:01.949 --> 28:05.035
Hope to hear good news from you.

28:05.059 --> 28:06.539
What good news?

28:06.539 --> 28:08.919
She is talking about the bookstore.

28:10.669 --> 28:12.089
Grandma, look here.

28:13.989 --> 28:16.515
This one is particularly good.

28:16.539 --> 28:17.959
Let me have a look.

28:19.339 --> 28:20.819
You took such an ugly picture of me!

28:20.819 --> 28:21.340
So ugly!

28:21.340 --> 28:22.899
You're cute. You don't understand!

28:22.899 --> 28:23.899
What? Cute?

28:23.899 --> 28:24.899
I sent it.

28:24.899 --> 28:26.179
I sent it over.

28:27.139 --> 28:29.075
You want to taste my fist?

28:29.099 --> 28:29.819
Don't.

28:29.819 --> 28:32.029
I'll send a box to Ms. Xie.

28:32.029 --> 28:32.820
It hurts.

28:32.820 --> 28:34.635
I need to go.

28:37.789 --> 28:39.269
Come, eat peaches.

28:45.059 --> 28:45.859
Sweet.

28:45.859 --> 28:47.139
So sweet.

28:47.139 --> 28:49.099
You sent more than 100 kg over?

28:49.099 --> 28:51.359
How much does this express cost?

28:52.339 --> 28:53.469
It's a pity.

28:53.469 --> 28:54.819
She is a good girl.

28:54.819 --> 28:56.539
Unfortunately, she is not used to living here.

28:56.539 --> 28:58.189
Did you see Yao the other day?

28:58.189 --> 28:59.539
He was angry for a while.

28:59.539 --> 29:00.819
He didn't talk for a while.

29:00.819 --> 29:03.919
He was like a deflated balloon, out of spirits.

29:04.299 --> 29:06.229
He came here this morning.

29:06.229 --> 29:07.429
He is pretty good.

29:07.429 --> 29:10.349
He is in good spirits, smiling all the time.

29:11.539 --> 29:14.989
So men and women are not the same.

29:14.989 --> 29:17.749
If a man breaks up, he won't be
brokenhearted for more than a week.

29:17.749 --> 29:19.589
Even Mr. Xie is like this.

29:19.619 --> 29:22.203
I am disappointed in men.

29:22.539 --> 29:23.579
You are right.

29:23.579 --> 29:24.989
Men forget quickly.

29:24.989 --> 29:26.189
Look at Baoping.

29:26.189 --> 29:29.789
She didn't get married after her husband
was gone for years.

29:29.789 --> 29:30.030
Right.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.709
And Mr. Crow.

29:31.709 --> 29:34.669
After his wife was gone for less than 100 days,

29:34.669 --> 29:37.099
he went to a matchmaker to get him a new one.

29:37.099 --> 29:38.139
Shameless!

29:38.139 --> 29:39.899
That old man is shameless.

29:39.899 --> 29:41.179
Shameless.

29:42.099 --> 29:45.139
But, Chuchu, Yue, don't despair.

29:45.139 --> 29:46.949
There are still good men.

29:46.949 --> 29:49.341
Like Guanjun.

29:50.539 --> 29:52.451
Guanjun is really good.

29:52.899 --> 29:54.789
Don't blow your own horn.

29:54.789 --> 29:57.189
You will know when similar things happen.

29:57.189 --> 29:58.469
You're right.

29:58.669 --> 29:59.539
Sweet?

29:59.539 --> 30:00.819
Sweet.

30:08.859 --> 30:10.139
Open your mouth.

30:12.539 --> 30:13.819
Sweet?

30:14.469 --> 30:15.749
Sweet.

30:16.859 --> 30:18.059
Don't look at me.

30:18.059 --> 30:19.407
Try one.

30:25.029 --> 30:26.309
Sweet.

30:26.539 --> 30:27.819
Sister,

30:27.899 --> 30:31.029
you asked Nana for those bottles
of wine, and those cans and jars.

30:31.029 --> 30:32.569
Why do you need them?

30:32.669 --> 30:34.089
I want to do magic.

30:34.819 --> 30:36.719
Don't beat around the bush.

30:37.339 --> 30:39.619
Don't throw the peach kernel
after you eat the peach.

30:39.619 --> 30:40.899
Keep it for me.

30:41.299 --> 30:43.019
What do you need it for?

30:43.299 --> 30:45.099
It's all about life.

30:45.099 --> 30:46.379
Understand?

30:49.789 --> 30:51.069
Come here.

30:52.429 --> 30:54.965
Your hair is too long.

30:54.989 --> 30:56.469
I'll cut it for you.

30:56.859 --> 30:58.339
You can also cut hair?

30:58.339 --> 30:59.100
Of course.

30:59.100 --> 31:00.539
My daughter's hair is cut by me.

31:00.539 --> 31:01.819
That's great.

31:01.819 --> 31:02.190
You know what?

31:02.190 --> 31:04.229
The barbershop here is too expensive.

31:04.229 --> 31:06.229
It costs several dozen yuan for a haircut.

31:06.229 --> 31:08.379
In return, you have to sing a song for me.

31:08.379 --> 31:09.339
Sure.

31:09.339 --> 31:10.749
What song do you want to hear?

31:10.749 --> 31:11.949
The Wind.

31:11.949 --> 31:13.269
Blow it away.

31:13.269 --> 31:17.905
Blow it away, in my
face... I'll get the guitar.

31:19.899 --> 31:21.179
Jiahui!

31:36.489 --> 31:37.749
♫ The journey ♫

31:37.749 --> 31:38.379
Hello.

31:38.379 --> 31:38.819
♫ One step to the stars ♫

31:38.819 --> 31:39.190
Hello.

31:39.190 --> 31:41.709
This is our special Sugar Peach.

31:41.709 --> 31:41.950
♫ One step to the rainbow ♫

31:41.950 --> 31:43.299
Please have a try.

31:43.299 --> 31:44.509
Thank you.

31:44.509 --> 31:45.099
Thank you.

31:45.099 --> 31:45.620
You're welcome.

31:45.620 --> 31:49.388
♫ Miss and embrace ♫

31:49.389 --> 31:50.669
♫ In the world ♫

31:50.669 --> 31:53.029
♫ Where there is a breeze ♫

31:53.029 --> 31:54.309
Hello.

31:54.469 --> 31:56.749
This is our special Sugar Peach.

31:56.749 --> 31:57.669
Please try it.

31:57.669 --> 31:58.749
Thank you.

31:58.749 --> 32:00.029
You're welcome.

32:01.099 --> 32:02.379
Please enjoy.

32:02.789 --> 32:04.539
♫ In the street with rain or sunshine ♫

32:04.539 --> 32:06.269
You guys look so unnatural.

32:06.269 --> 32:07.099
It's not real.

32:07.099 --> 32:08.669
Come on, look at each other.

32:08.669 --> 32:09.539
Looking at each other.

32:09.539 --> 32:12.139
And you should smile.

32:12.139 --> 32:14.189
It's like this peach is very tasty.

32:14.189 --> 32:15.189
Okay, that's it.

32:15.189 --> 32:16.579
3, 2, 1.

32:16.579 --> 32:18.229
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

32:18.229 --> 32:19.139
Good.

32:19.139 --> 32:20.419
Off you go.

32:21.389 --> 32:24.189
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

32:24.189 --> 32:27.049
Why do I feel we have been used like tools?

32:27.139 --> 32:28.487
It's okay.

32:28.539 --> 32:33.427
I am worried that he will go back to Beijing
for Xu Hongdou on impulse.

32:34.689 --> 32:36.989
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

32:36.989 --> 32:38.469
I don't want to eat.

32:38.789 --> 32:42.589
♫ Maybe it will work out the way
I want it to ♫

32:42.589 --> 32:47.477
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

32:47.839 --> 32:52.245
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

32:52.269 --> 32:55.489
♫ Love as a teenager ♫

32:55.489 --> 32:57.539
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

32:57.539 --> 33:00.669
Let's take a look at the gifts
your auntie prepared.

33:00.669 --> 33:05.465
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

33:05.489 --> 33:06.989
♫ Maybe it will work out ♫

33:06.989 --> 33:08.469
Tiger head shoes?

33:09.539 --> 33:11.979
This is made by a grandma in Yunnan.

33:12.059 --> 33:13.189
She wouldn't take the money.

33:13.189 --> 33:15.389
Every stitch is her heart.

33:18.139 --> 33:20.279
If our grandma was still alive,

33:20.749 --> 33:23.099
she should also make tiger head shoes
for my baby.

33:23.099 --> 33:25.139
There is our grandma's smell on her body.

33:25.139 --> 33:26.419
Smell it.

33:29.059 --> 33:30.339
It's true.

33:32.619 --> 33:34.879
It's the smell of boiled peanuts.

33:34.949 --> 33:36.813
Not the smell of toast?

33:37.059 --> 33:38.587
It's boiled peanuts.

33:44.819 --> 33:46.299
Wipe it off quickly.

33:46.379 --> 33:50.378
If our mom sees this, she would
think I have done something to you.

33:50.379 --> 33:52.299
I'm fine. I'm pregnant.

33:52.299 --> 33:54.163
I'm just sensitive.

33:58.819 --> 34:00.099
Kexin.

34:00.709 --> 34:02.629
How is your husband treating you?

34:02.629 --> 34:04.013
Not bad.

34:04.229 --> 34:05.979
We are both quite lazy.

34:05.979 --> 34:07.669
His mother spoiled him. He knows nothing.

34:07.669 --> 34:09.709
My mom spoiled me and I can't do anything.

34:09.709 --> 34:10.789
Two childish adults.

34:10.789 --> 34:12.915
We don't frown upon each other.

34:12.939 --> 34:15.391
Fortune favors fools.

34:16.379 --> 34:17.339
Sister.

34:17.339 --> 34:19.019
I didn't find a perfect guy.

34:19.019 --> 34:21.819
You have to be careful to find a good one.

34:24.339 --> 34:26.299
How good does it have to be?

34:26.979 --> 34:28.629
First, he has to be handsome.

34:28.629 --> 34:29.819
He can make money.

34:29.819 --> 34:30.749
And then?

34:30.749 --> 34:31.899
His family spirit should be good.

34:31.899 --> 34:33.899
His parents have to be reasonable.

34:33.899 --> 34:35.629
He can afford a house in Beijing.

34:35.629 --> 34:38.749
At the very least, he should have
a Beijing household registration.

34:38.749 --> 34:40.229
If he is not from Beijing?

34:40.229 --> 34:41.769
Shanghai is fine too.

34:43.589 --> 34:44.939
What about Yunnan?

34:44.939 --> 34:46.219
Yunnan?

34:46.299 --> 34:47.827
Yunnan is...

34:49.419 --> 34:51.939
You fell in love with someone from Yunnan?

34:51.939 --> 34:55.275
Do you have a one-night stand in Yunnan?

34:55.299 --> 34:56.549
What are you talking about?

34:56.549 --> 34:58.269
Don't let your mom and my mom hear it.

34:58.269 --> 34:59.589
Who do you like?

34:59.589 --> 35:00.899
You know what?

35:00.899 --> 35:02.860
If you are not pregnant, I'll beat you.

35:02.860 --> 35:04.831
What are you talking about?

35:05.109 --> 35:06.109
Baby.

35:06.109 --> 35:07.541
Mom is so scared.

35:07.789 --> 35:10.229
Why are you getting mad?

35:10.229 --> 35:12.069
You are the most annoying.

35:13.109 --> 35:14.339
Get down to business.

35:14.339 --> 35:16.539
Have you found your new job yet?

35:17.149 --> 35:18.725
New job?

35:19.669 --> 35:20.459
Auntie said

35:20.459 --> 35:23.189
you're tired of the hotel you worked
for ten years in Beijing,

35:23.189 --> 35:25.293
and want to find a new one.

35:26.549 --> 35:27.829
How's it going?

35:38.709 --> 35:39.459
Slow down.

35:39.459 --> 35:40.739
Mom.

35:42.979 --> 35:44.859
Is there anything I can help?

35:44.859 --> 35:46.735
Just wait and eat.

35:54.899 --> 35:56.109
Mom.

35:56.109 --> 35:57.149
Mom, mom.

35:57.149 --> 35:58.459
What are you doing?

35:58.459 --> 35:59.819
Say what you want.

36:02.819 --> 36:04.971
How did you know I resigned?

36:06.859 --> 36:09.339
Gang from auntie Sun is going to visit Beijing.

36:09.339 --> 36:12.669
She called your hotel, to
see if she can get a discount

36:12.669 --> 36:14.189
by mentioning your name.

36:14.189 --> 36:17.625
But they told her Manager Xu resigned.

36:22.069 --> 36:23.019
Xu Hongdou.

36:23.019 --> 36:25.549
Now you should know you can't hide anything.

36:25.549 --> 36:27.819
From childhood to adulthood,

36:27.819 --> 36:30.799
whenever you lie, you will be exposed, right?

36:31.019 --> 36:32.109
You know I resigned.

36:32.109 --> 36:33.541
Why didn't you ask?

36:34.229 --> 36:36.109
I see you're out there, having a good time.

36:36.109 --> 36:36.670
What should I ask?

36:36.670 --> 36:38.749
We can talk about it when you come back.

36:38.749 --> 36:41.229
You didn't ask about it when I got back.

36:41.229 --> 36:42.509
Then tell me.

36:43.589 --> 36:45.069
It's nothing really.

36:45.149 --> 36:47.979
You told me when I was a child
that the slow need to start early.

36:47.979 --> 36:49.589
I can't fly anymore.

36:49.589 --> 36:50.380
I'm tired.

36:50.380 --> 36:53.011
I just want to take a break.

36:53.629 --> 36:55.253
It's okay not to fly.

36:55.379 --> 36:57.699
It's good to fly back to the nest.

36:57.899 --> 37:01.299
Our family is counting on Xu
Hongmi, the little cash catcher,

37:01.299 --> 37:02.923
to catch money for us.

37:03.229 --> 37:07.709
Just like the nest of swallows under the eaves
of your grandma's house.

37:08.899 --> 37:10.229
Mom.

37:10.229 --> 37:12.093
I'm telling you seriously.

37:13.379 --> 37:14.019
Okay.

37:14.019 --> 37:14.939
Let's talk seriously.

37:14.939 --> 37:16.239
What's your plan?

37:20.189 --> 37:24.237
Your dad and your sister,
want you to go to Shanghai.

37:25.269 --> 37:28.285
I actually have an HR friend,

37:28.589 --> 37:30.669
telling me their hotel's training
department is recruiting.

37:30.669 --> 37:32.299
The job is quite suitable for me.

37:32.299 --> 37:34.645
A normal working hour job.

37:34.669 --> 37:36.749
No need for a 24-hour standby.

37:37.749 --> 37:39.085
That's good.

37:39.189 --> 37:41.101
As long as you like it.

37:41.149 --> 37:42.709
You don't have to worry about me and your dad.

37:42.709 --> 37:43.899
We have some savings.

37:43.899 --> 37:45.339
We don't spend much either.

37:45.339 --> 37:47.299
And again, there is your sister.

37:47.299 --> 37:49.819
As long as you can feed
yourself, I won't worry about you.

37:49.819 --> 37:52.067
Don't be so stressed.

37:52.859 --> 37:55.899
But I don't want to be much worse than my sis.

37:57.229 --> 37:59.657
Why do you always compare with her?

37:59.819 --> 38:01.549
I am not.

38:01.549 --> 38:05.429
It's just from childhood to adulthood,
you always compare me with her.

38:06.789 --> 38:07.899
That's my fault.

38:07.899 --> 38:09.379
I shouldn't have done this.

38:09.379 --> 38:10.339
We are wrong.

38:10.339 --> 38:11.269
I apologize to you.

38:11.269 --> 38:12.069
I was wrong.

38:12.069 --> 38:13.899
Mom, you're so quick to admit you're wrong.

38:13.899 --> 38:15.299
It is a pre-emptive strike.

38:15.299 --> 38:17.379
I don't even know what to say.

38:17.709 --> 38:19.549
You don't know what to say,
just don't say anything.

38:19.549 --> 38:21.379
Wait for the dumplings.

38:21.379 --> 38:22.589
No more water, okay?

38:22.589 --> 38:24.741
Leave it to me, okay?

38:33.749 --> 38:36.333
These people are really bad.

38:38.819 --> 38:40.099
This is nice.

38:45.979 --> 38:47.259
I am done.

38:47.589 --> 38:48.459
It's my turn.

38:48.459 --> 38:49.739
Okay.

38:53.899 --> 38:55.631
I'll give you a massage.

38:56.709 --> 38:58.189
How's it?

38:58.229 --> 38:59.589
Wow, the strength.

39:03.949 --> 39:09.389
[Xie Zhiyao: How many peaches do you pick?
Why don't you reply after coming back home?]

39:22.629 --> 39:23.909
What's going on?

39:26.019 --> 39:27.299
Who is it?

39:27.819 --> 39:29.443
Hongdou is calling.

39:30.069 --> 39:31.393
Answer it.

39:37.189 --> 39:39.473
Stupid boy.

39:53.979 --> 39:54.899
Hello?

39:54.899 --> 39:56.109
Can you hear me?

39:56.109 --> 39:57.549
Hello, are you busy?

39:57.549 --> 39:59.709
Why didn't you answer my call just now?

39:59.709 --> 40:01.419
I was with my grandma just now.

40:01.419 --> 40:02.755
I went upstairs.

40:04.749 --> 40:06.181
What are you doing?

40:07.339 --> 40:08.589
I am packing up my books.

40:08.589 --> 40:10.669
I am going to move these days.

40:15.339 --> 40:18.019
I didn't have time to reply this afternoon.

40:18.019 --> 40:20.019
My aunt brought my cousin over here.

40:20.019 --> 40:21.189
It was noisy.

40:21.189 --> 40:23.245
Everyone was making dumplings.

40:23.269 --> 40:25.189
My cousin is pregnant for several months.

40:25.189 --> 40:26.849
I was playing with her.

40:28.749 --> 40:30.029
No wonder.

40:30.299 --> 40:32.749
In fact, if you call me this
afternoon, I can't pick it up either.

40:32.749 --> 40:35.379
I was having a meeting about
the bookstore in the village.

40:35.379 --> 40:36.659
Any progress?

40:37.549 --> 40:39.859
The team will officially come to visit
in a few days,

40:39.859 --> 40:40.899
negotiating the reception.

40:40.899 --> 40:43.099
I'll cooperate with the village.

40:46.069 --> 40:47.609
About the guesthouse.

40:47.709 --> 40:50.189
Some guys will come to see the place
in a few days.

40:50.189 --> 40:51.525
Not easy to sell?

40:51.589 --> 40:52.549
Not easy.

40:52.549 --> 40:54.749
The guy who wants to take
it, offers a very low price.

40:54.749 --> 40:56.109
He just wants a steal.

40:56.109 --> 40:57.709
The previous owner is in want of money.

40:57.709 --> 41:00.629
The price has been dropping again and again.

41:02.069 --> 41:03.349
I see.

41:05.459 --> 41:07.019
Let's not talk about that.

41:07.019 --> 41:08.799
It's all about annoyance.

41:20.339 --> 41:22.144
The noodles your mother
made... How's your throat?

41:26.589 --> 41:29.149
Why didn't you give me a like
since you've seen it?

41:29.149 --> 41:32.621
When I saw it, you've
posted it for eleven hours.

41:32.859 --> 41:35.299
Is it appropriate to give a like for
things like that?

41:35.299 --> 41:36.689
It doesn't matter to me.

41:36.689 --> 41:38.145
♫ The journey ♫

41:38.349 --> 41:39.020
♫ One step to the stars ♫

41:39.020 --> 41:41.245
You didn't give me a like either.

41:41.269 --> 41:43.859
When I saw it, it's also
been more than ten hours.

41:43.859 --> 41:45.709
When you posted it,
I went to the hospital.

41:45.709 --> 41:47.109
♫ Miss and embrace ♫

41:47.109 --> 41:48.389
Okay.

41:49.789 --> 41:50.709
♫ In the world ♫

41:50.709 --> 41:52.229
So... ♫ Where there is a breeze ♫

41:52.229 --> 41:53.517
are we good?

41:54.589 --> 41:56.939
♫ Where the heart is hidden ♫

41:56.939 --> 41:59.299
So... keep in touch?

41:59.299 --> 42:03.047
♫ Fill whose dreams ♫

42:03.229 --> 42:05.189
♫ In the street with rain ♫

42:05.189 --> 42:05.900
Why are you laughing?

42:05.900 --> 42:06.979
♫ or sunshine ♫

42:06.979 --> 42:08.819
Can't I laugh when I am happy?

42:08.819 --> 42:09.979
Aren't you happy to be home?

42:09.979 --> 42:12.465
♫ The time of walking and walking far ♫

42:12.489 --> 42:15.549
♫ Before saying goodbye ♫

42:15.549 --> 42:17.109
I can't talk to you right now.

42:17.109 --> 42:19.405
Have a good rest. Good night.

42:20.149 --> 42:20.669
Sure.

42:20.669 --> 42:21.669
That's it.

42:21.669 --> 42:22.190
Good night.

42:22.190 --> 42:26.065
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

42:26.089 --> 42:29.839
♫ Love as a teenager ♫

42:29.839 --> 42:34.259
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

42:34.789 --> 42:39.029
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

42:40.339 --> 42:41.459
What are you doing?

42:41.459 --> 42:43.299
Your mom is eavesdropping.

42:44.299 --> 42:45.229
Xu Jianguo!

42:45.229 --> 42:46.229
You...

42:51.989 --> 42:58.497
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:59.429 --> 43:05.313
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:06.839 --> 43:13.208
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:13.209 --> 43:19.609
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:21.549 --> 43:27.961
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:28.919 --> 43:34.695
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:36.349 --> 43:42.878
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:42.879 --> 43:50.251
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:51.159 --> 43:57.599
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

43:57.599 --> 44:05.599
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:05.729 --> 44:07.779
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:07.779 --> 44:12.408
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:12.409 --> 44:20.749
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

44:24.419 --> 44:30.555
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:31.749 --> 44:38.125
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:39.139 --> 44:45.559
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:45.559 --> 44:53.559
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:53.919 --> 45:00.369
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:00.369 --> 45:08.373
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:08.579 --> 45:10.559
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:10.559 --> 45:15.159
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:15.159 --> 45:22.518
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

45:22.519 --> 45:30.535
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
